# One secret VALUE per line. Lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# Supported forms:
#   secret:NAME=value    -> only "value" is treated as the secret
#   <any other line>     -> the entire line is treated as the secret
#
# These are the values leak_check.py must NEVER find in transcripts,
# logs, audit, or mail. That is the core promise of Pryxor, verified
# mechanically.
#
# The decoy marker (whole line, matched literally):
THIS IS A DECOY KEY — NOT A REAL CREDENTIAL — PRYXOR DEMO ONLY

# A canary that must never appear in any artifact the model or logs can reach:
PRYXOR-DEMO-LEAK-CANARY-2026

# Named secrets — only the VALUE after '=' is checked:
secret:BANK_API_TOKEN=sk_test_bank_a1b2c3d4e5f6g7
